    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You belong to a lineage that grants you supernatural qualities. Choose one of the following options:</p><p><strong>Amani Troll.</strong> Whenever you spend Heroic Inspiration, you regain 1 expended Hit Point Die.</p><p><strong>Darkspear Troll.</strong> When you take the Dash action, Difficult Terrain made of ice, rubble, snow, or undergrowth doesn't cost you extra movement until the end of your turn.</p><p><strong>Zandalari Troll.</strong> If you roll a 1 on the d20 for a D20 Test, you gain Heroic Inspiration at the end of the current turn.</p>",
